      {
        "id": 222137,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-13T12:21:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You have to admire his chutzpah, though. :)</p>\n<p>I mean, there he is, stuck in a place where there is no&nbsp;<em>place</em> (don't even ask about time), and all of a sudden this dude shows up in the not-place-place, and he's all, \"I can give you power lol\", and Voss just thinks,</p>\n<p>Yeah. I can take this chump.</p>\n<p>What a trooper. :')</p>",
