        "id": 222138,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-13T13:00:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, yeah.&nbsp; The sheer cajones on Voss--'arrogance' was the term C&amp;A threw around quite often, and rightly so--make it all pretty unfathomable.</p>\n<p>Here's one of the extant forces in the universe, and Voss thinks he can punch it into submission.&nbsp; It'd be unbelievable if Voss didn't actually believe that he was taht good at combat...</p>",
