        "created_at": "2025-10-08T19:43:50.693Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I absolutely believe, not only can Fanatic punch Dark Mind because she believes she can, but Legacy can punch Dark Mind, and she is hurt by that punch, because his charisma and enthusiasm and absolute Americanness is antithetical to her sadistic psionic essence.  Now, why Parse can shoot her with an arrow, that I got nothing for.</p>",
